==Czech==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|cs|zlw-ocs|psáti}}, {{l|zlw-ocs|pisati}}, from {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*pьsati}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{audio|cs|Cs-psát.ogg|audio}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|psát}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=i|aa=napsat}}

# {{lb|cs|ambitransitive}} to [[write]]
#: {{uxi|cs|Pořád '''píšu''' dopisy.|I still '''write''' letters.}}
#: {{coi|cs|'''psat''' domácí úkol|to do the homework}}
#: {{uxi|cs|Celé odpoledne '''jsem psal''' domácí úkol.|I spent the whole afternoon doing my homework.}}
#: {{uxi|cs|Jak se to '''píše'''?|How is that '''written'''?}}

